   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Bir robotik atölyesinde öğrenciler, kareli bir zeminde hareket eden bir robotu komutlarla yönlendirmektedir. Robot başlangıçta A1 karesinde ve kuzeye (yukarı) bakmaktadır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 345 290\" width=\"345\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"6x6 ızgara, A1 karesinde kuzeye bakan robot, C4, E2 ve D6 karelerinde engel\"><g font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"14\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"14\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"14\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"14\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"14\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"14\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"54\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"54\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"54\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"54\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"54\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"54\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"94\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"94\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"94\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"94\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"94\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"94\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"134\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"134\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"134\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"134\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"134\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"134\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"174\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"174\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"174\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"174\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"174\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"174\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"214\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"214\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"214\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"214\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"214\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"214\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"122\" y=\"96\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#475569\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"118\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"11\">engel</text><rect x=\"162\" y=\"16\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#475569\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"11\">engel</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"176\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#475569\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"198\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"11\">engel</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"270\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"270\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"270\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"270\" font-weight=\"bold\">D</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"270\" font-weight=\"bold\">E</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"270\" font-weight=\"bold\">F</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"38\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"118\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"158\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"198\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"238\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><polygon points=\"60,220 49,245 71,245\" fill=\"#f97316\" stroke=\"#9a3412\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\">Kuzey</text><line x1=\"315\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M310,54 L315,44 L320,54 z\" fill=\"#334155\"/></g></svg></div><p>Robotun komutları ve kuralları şunlardır:</p><ul><li><b>İ</b> ve yanındaki sayı, robotun baktığı yönde o sayı kadar kare ilerleyeceğini gösterir (İ3: üç kare ileri).</li><li><b>S</b> komutunda robot olduğu yerde sağa, <b>L</b> komutunda sola 90 derece döner.</li><li>İlerlerken önündeki karede engel varsa robot o komuttaki kalan adımları yapmaz, durduğu karede bir sonraki komuta geçer.</li></ul><p>Robota sırasıyla şu komutlar verilmiştir: <b>İ3 – S – İ4 – S – İ2 – L – İ2 – L – İ3</b></p><p class=\"ask\">Bu bilgilere göre robot, komutların tamamını uyguladıktan sonra hangi karede bulunur?</p>",
