   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Bir bilmece kulübündeki öğrenciler, mesajlarını Türk alfabesini kullanarak şifrelemektedir. Şifrede her harfin yerine, alfabede o harften <b>iki sonra</b> gelen harf yazılır. Alfabenin son harflerinden sonra yeniden baştan sayılır (Y → A, Z → B).</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 96\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Türk alfabesinin 29 harfi sırayla\"><g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"31\">A</text><rect x=\"46\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"31\">B</text><rect x=\"82\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"31\">C</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"134\" y=\"31\">Ç</text><rect x=\"154\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"31\">D</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"206\" y=\"31\">E</text><rect x=\"226\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"242\" y=\"31\">F</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"278\" y=\"31\">G</text><rect x=\"298\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"314\" y=\"31\">Ğ</text><rect x=\"334\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"31\">H</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"31\">I</text><rect x=\"406\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"422\" y=\"31\">İ</text><rect x=\"442\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"458\" y=\"31\">J</text><rect x=\"478\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"494\" y=\"31\">K</text><rect x=\"514\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"530\" y=\"31\">L</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"75\">M</text><rect x=\"46\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"75\">N</text><rect x=\"82\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"75\">O</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"134\" y=\"75\">Ö</text><rect x=\"154\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"75\">P</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"206\" y=\"75\">R</text><rect x=\"226\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"242\" y=\"75\">S</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"278\" y=\"75\">Ş</text><rect x=\"298\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"314\" y=\"75\">T</text><rect x=\"334\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"75\">U</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"75\">Ü</text><rect x=\"406\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"422\" y=\"75\">V</text><rect x=\"442\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"458\" y=\"75\">Y</text><rect x=\"478\" y=\"52\" width=\"32\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\"/><text x=\"494\" y=\"75\">Z</text></g></svg></div><p>Örnek: “ZİL” sözcüğünün şifresi “BKN” olur.</p><p class=\"ask\">Bu kurala göre “KİTAP” sözcüğünün şifresi aşağıdakilerden hangisidir?</p>",
