   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Çeyrek final: Ali–Barış, Can–Derya, Eda–Fatih, Gizem–Hakan.</li> <li>Barış ve Gizem hiç kazanamadı; Derya ilk maçında Can’ı yendi.</li> <li>Fatih yarı finalde Hakan’a yenildi.</li> <li>Şampiyon, Derya’yı yenen öğrencidir.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p><b>Kesinlikle doğru</b> olan yargı.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Çeyrek finalleri çöz</b> Kazanamayanlar rakiplerine yenilmiştir; Fatih yarı finale çıktığına göre Eda’yı yenmiştir. <span class=\"sv-m\">Ali &gt; Barış · Derya &gt; Can · Fatih &gt; Eda · Hakan &gt; Gizem</span></li> <li><b>Yarı finalleri yaz</b> Alt yarı finali Hakan kazanmıştır. Üst yarı finalde Ali ile Derya karşılaşır. <span class=\"sv-m\">Üst: Ali – Derya · Alt: Hakan &gt; Fatih</span></li> <li><b>Şampiyon koşulunu dene</b> «Şampiyon olan öğrenci, turnuvada Derya’yı yenen öğrencidir» → Derya şampiyon olamaz ve şampiyon Derya’yla oynamış olmalı. <span class=\"sv-m\">Durum 1: Ali Derya’yı yener, finalde Hakan’ı da yener → şampiyon Ali ✓</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">Durum 2: Derya Ali’yi yener, finalde Hakan Derya’yı yener → şampiyon Hakan ✓</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">Ali yarı finali alıp finali kaybederse şampiyon Hakan olur ama Derya’yı yenmemiştir ✗</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 470 250\" width=\"470\" role=\"img\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"18\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ali</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"46\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">Barış</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"74\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">Can</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"102\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Derya</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"130\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">Eda</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"158\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Fatih</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"186\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">Gizem</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"214\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Hakan</text><path d=\"M82,29 H100 V57 H82 M100,43 H120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><path d=\"M82,85 H100 V113 H82 M100,99 H120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><path d=\"M82,141 H100 V169 H82 M100,155 H120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><path d=\"M82,197 H100 V225 H82 M100,211 H120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"32\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#16a34a\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ali</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"88\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#16a34a\" font-weight=\"bold\">Derya</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"144\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-weight=\"bold\">Fatih</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"200\" width=\"76\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Hakan</text><path d=\"M196,43 H214 V99 H196 M214,71 H234\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><path d=\"M196,155 H214 V211 H196 M214,183 H234\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"234\" y=\"60\" width=\"126\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"297\" y=\"76\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#16a34a\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ali ya da Derya</text><rect x=\"234\" y=\"172\" width=\"126\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"297\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\">Hakan</text><path d=\"M360,71 H372 V183 H360 M372,127 H384\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Final</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Hakan hep</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">finalde</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\">Çeyrek</text><text x=\"158\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\">Yarı final</text></svg><figcaption>Kesinleşen sonuçlar: Hakan alt yarıyı kazanır ve her durumda finaldedir</figcaption></figure><table class=\"sv-c\"><tr><td>A</td><td>Durum 2’de şampiyon Hakan’dır.</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>Durum 2’de Derya iki maç kazanır.</td></tr><tr class=\"ok\"><td>C</td><td>İki durumda da Hakan finalde oynar. <b>Kesin doğru.</b></td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>Durum 1’de Hakan ile Derya karşılaşmaz.</td></tr></table><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Eleme tablosunda her tur için kazananı yaz; belirsiz kalan maçta iki ihtimali de dene, her ikisinde ortak olanı seç.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> A, yalnızca birinci durumu düşünen öğrenciyi yakalar; «Derya’yı yenen» koşulu ikinci bir şampiyon ihtimali de bırakır.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
